Create Your First Webpage

Now you’ll create your own website 🔥

👉 Run this command:

sudo nano index.html
✍️ Add this inside:
<h1>Hello Akash 🚀</h1>
<p>My first AWS Cloud Project</p>
💾 Save the file

In nano:

Press CTRL + X
Press Y
Press Enter
🎯 Now Check

👉 Go to browser:

http://<your-ec2-public-ip>
